.","language":"en","languageLabel":"الإنجليزية"}],"imageGallery":[]}],"wordForms":[],"search":"إعادة إدماج الأطفال المرتبطين سابقا بالنزاع المسلح (كفاك)  Kafak Project   A Saudi humanitarian project undertaken by the King Salman Humanitarian Aid and Relief Centre, dedicated to rehabilitating child soldiers and children affected by the armed conflict in Yemen, reintegrating them into society, and providing them with social support. The project was launched in Marib Governorate in September 2017.","nonDiacriticsLemma":"إعادة إدماج الأطفال المرتبطين سابقا بالنزاع المسلح كفاك","metaData":{"periodDateFrom":null,"periodDateTo":null},"lammaDetails":[{"form":"إعادة إدماج الأطفال المرتبطين سابقًا بالنزاع المسلح (كفاك)"}],"autoGeneratedRoot":null,"entryRelations":[],"dynamicProps":[]}}
